### 3. Verification of Invariant Integrity

- **Art. 1.1 (Biocentric Primacy):** Hardened reserves of high-entropy technical components protect water filtration (RO membranes) and local microgrids, preventing human die-off or biospheric toxic dumping during industrial collapse.
- **Art. 1.2 (Somatic Integrity & Non-Carceral Status):** Infiltrators neutralized during grey-zone conduit sabotage cannot be executed, tortured, or thrown into punitive isolation cells; they must be remitted to somatic stabilization and restorative consensus tribunals.
- **Art. 1.3 (Inalienable Universal Baseline):** Caches of life-critical components cannot be diverted to private markets or military cabals; they remain sealed usufruct reserves.
- **Art. 1.5 (Non-Enclosure):** Defense remains tethered to sortition-based rotation. No permanent standing officer corps or corporate security contractors can be instantiated. Point-defense perimeter constraints prevent expansionist or offensive war-making.